# systemd-sysusers(8) entries for orion-node.service. Install as /usr/lib/sysusers.d/orion.conf.
# The orion system user and group own /var/lib/orion and /run/orion; membership in dialout gives
# access to serial MCU links. `m` also creates dialout if the image has no such group.
# Fixed uid/gid 901, as in packaging/buildroot/orion-users.table (shared /data).
u orion 901 "Orion node" /var/lib/orion
m orion dialout
